WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.8 · Theory of Change
Assumptions, risks and evidence

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Before you launch, almost every link in your pathway rests on assumptions.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Ask what must be true at each link.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Test the important, uncertain ones cheaply first.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Decide in advance what you will do if one is false.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your critical assumptions, evidence and how you will test them.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
